<usx version="3.0"><book code="1SA" style="id">- TJs USFM Test</book><para style="h">1 Samuel</para><para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para><para style="mt1">1 Samuel</para><para style="imt">Introduction</para><para style="is">Introduction section heading</para><para style="ip">An introduction paragraph. Introduction material precedes the first chapter, so it lives in this book-start fixture rather than in a 2 Samuel chapter.</para><para style="io1">Outline entry one <char style="ior">1.1-4.22</char></para><para style="io2">Outline entry two <char style="ior">5.1-7.17</char></para><para style="ie" /><chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" /><para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />The first verse after the introduction.<verse eid="1SA 1:1" /></para><chapter eid="1SA 1" /></usx>